== Effects ==
* Upon use, gigantifies Isaac for 30 seconds, persisting between rooms and floors. While gigantic, Isaac gains the following effects:
** A 4x [[damage]] multiplier, +2 [[range]], and -1.9 [[tears]].
** Cannot take damage for the duration of the effect.
** Can destroy [[Object]]s, [[Obstacles]], and {{e|Pitfall}}s when walking over them. This includes [[Metal Block]]s and [[Key Block]]s without using keys.
** Can break through normal doors, {{r|Secret Room}}s, and any doors that require {{e|Bomb}}s such as {{r|Clean Bedroom}}s, by walking into them.
*** Cannot break through {{r|Challenge Room}}s, {{r|Boss Room}}s, {{r|Mini-Boss Room}}s, {{r|Curse Room}}s, {{r|Sacrifice Room}}s, or any doors that require {{e|Key}}s such as {{r|Shop}}s. Bedrooms also cannot be broken back into if they are closed but no longer boarded up.
** Deals extremely heavy contact damage to enemies (80 per tick, or 2,400 per second).
* {{transformation contribution|Fun Guy}}

== Notes ==
* Using Mega Mush again while its effects are still active will add an additional 30 seconds to the current active time.
* Isaac's physical size, i.e. collision circle or "hitbox" is roughly doubled in radius when Mega Mush is active. This is the only item that can make Isaac tangibly larger than his starting size, as normal size ups can't increase the collision area beyond the default.
* Mega Mush will not negate the damage taken from the {{S|Mausoleum}} door and the {{E|Golden Battery}}. It is also possible to die this way.
* Non-tear based attacks such as {{i|Brimstone}} or {{i|Mom's Knife}} are overridden by normal tears while Mega Mush is active.
** The only exceptions are the melee attacks by {{c|The Forgotten}}, {{c|Tainted Samson}} and {{i|Berserk!}}, which have increased hitboxes.
* Isaac is unable to use the invulnerability effect to donate to {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}s and {{M|Devil Beggar}}s, since they will be destroyed on contact. {{M|Bomb Bum}}s will also be destroyed by walking over them.
* Mega Mush can be obtained by using {{i|Spindown Dice}} on {{i|Knife Piece 1}}.
* If Isaac dies while giant, he will revive in his giant form if he has any [[revival item]]s.
* Using Mega Mush as {{c|Tainted Lazarus}} will retain effect and time remaining upon flipping back to the form that used it.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|4.5 Volt}}: The contact damage dealt by Mega Mush will allow it to be recharged and used multiple times in the same room.
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Mega Mush's active time will be doubled to 60 seconds.
* {{I|Rock Bottom}}: Retains massive damage increase after Mega Mush's timer is up, though can make it nearly impossible to raise it afterwards without another use.
* {{i|Serpent's Kiss}}: Enemies killed with contact damage will frequently drop hearts.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Book of Virtues}}: Spawns a basic wisp.
* {{i|Keeper's Kin}}: Destroying [[rocks]] and [[blocks]] will allow Isaac to amass a lot of [[blue spider]]s.

